            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/bc61874fd45830dde161090fc46a2b77.avif?t=1789479263\" width=620 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shakes &amp; Fidget is a hilarious fantasy role-playing satire and at the same time, an award-winning RPG! Sounds crazy? With over 50 million enthusiastic players, it ranks among the most celebrated online role-playing games worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/38bb2b3e9813fb2e8b9025661e64e91c.webp?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own comic hero and conquer the top spot in the hall of fame! No easy feat, as real players have set their sights on the same goal. But together with your guild companions, you'll become stronger, more invincible, and win a ton of epic loot! Accept quests, embark on exciting adventures, brawl with monsters and other heroes, grow stronger, earn honor, and become a living legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/6943f2940430af311254e715f61bb9d4.webp?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/747ea5c7f63bc874271caf81a423bcef.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/747ea5c7f63bc874271caf81a423bcef.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/747ea5c7f63bc874271caf81a423bcef.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Poisons enemies with a toxic tincture for several rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/6b9d1a92b85d1265846db824a0154d7b.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/6b9d1a92b85d1265846db824a0154d7b.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/6b9d1a92b85d1265846db824a0154d7b.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blocks attacks with the shield, can heal or deal more damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e30f1c7d7985b15e835bc7009d2c6eb9.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e30f1c7d7985b15e835bc7009d2c6eb9.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e30f1c7d7985b15e835bc7009d2c6eb9.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Summons undead minions who sacrifice themselves in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/aad5084822f3924ea14501e5da514104.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/aad5084822f3924ea14501e5da514104.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/aad5084822f3924ea14501e5da514104.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Takes the form of an eagle or a bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a8123217ab05baefd92c1732a88a439c.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a8123217ab05baefd92c1732a88a439c.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a8123217ab05baefd92c1732a88a439c.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strengthens in battle by playing the harp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e95a688301653527fcdb06fc46d321c6.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e95a688301653527fcdb06fc46d321c6.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/e95a688301653527fcdb06fc46d321c6.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Has an elixir that can revive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cb3c8ef999588446f04df20aa60a93a9.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cb3c8ef999588446f04df20aa60a93a9.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cb3c8ef999588446f04df20aa60a93a9.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carries two weapons and always strikes with both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a85286df18bc9594f6ee73dd2ae03ba1.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a85286df18bc9594f6ee73dd2ae03ba1.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/a85286df18bc9594f6ee73dd2ae03ba1.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can dodge enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/1895a9acc6f304bbe24c27e5b42f18e9.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/1895a9acc6f304bbe24c27e5b42f18e9.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/1895a9acc6f304bbe24c27e5b42f18e9.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gets into a frenzy and can therefore attack several times in a row.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cf8f22c719faccc178c9ae804eb4e3b2.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cf8f22c719faccc178c9ae804eb4e3b2.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/cf8f22c719faccc178c9ae804eb4e3b2.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carries a shield that can be used to block attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/5ac2ec16086ddf857468c0b7894bc637.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/5ac2ec16086ddf857468c0b7894bc637.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/5ac2ec16086ddf857468c0b7894bc637.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Negates the special abilities of most other classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/715870ddba5db5455219c886a2906504.poster.avif?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/715870ddba5db5455219c886a2906504.webm?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/715870ddba5db5455219c886a2906504.mp4?t=1789479263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleashes an arcane comet at the opponent at the beginning of each battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/8dcada27bf0f053e6809c8ac04181315.webp?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique comic look and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of weapons and epic equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE alone and with friends and also PVP against other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting quests and scary dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-to-play and regular free updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-time registration via Steam, Facebook Connect or an email address and password is required, unless you already have a user account.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/bc61874fd45830dde161090fc46a2b77.avif?t=1789479263\" width=620 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shakes &amp; Fidget is a hilarious fantasy role-playing satire and at the same time, an award-winning RPG! Sounds crazy? With over 50 million enthusiastic players, it ranks among the most celebrated online role-playing games worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/38bb2b3e9813fb2e8b9025661e64e91c.webp?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own comic hero and conquer the top spot in the hall of fame! No easy feat, as real players have set their sights on the same goal. But together with your guild companions, you'll become stronger, more invincible, and win a ton of epic loot! Accept quests, embark on exciting adventures, brawl with monsters and other heroes, grow stronger, earn honor, and become a living legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/6943f2940430af311254e715f61bb9d4.webp?t=1789479263\" width=624 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/438040/extras/747ea5c7f6